Dialogue: 1,0:11:49.65,0:11:51.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,多谢你帮忙  孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.65,0:11:51.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Thanks for the help, sonny
Dialogue: 1,0:11:51.95,0:11:53.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不麻烦的  阿姨
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.95,0:11:53.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No trouble at all, ma'am
Dialogue: 1,0:11:53.55,0:11:57.26,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,高级童子军随时准备好帮助老人
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.55,0:11:57.26,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,A Senior Scout is always ready to help a senior citizen
Dialogue: 1,0:11:57.56,0:12:00.73,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,扶了一百位老人过马路
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.56,0:12:00.73,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Help one hundred senior citizens cross the street
Dialogue: 1,0:12:01.27,0:12:02.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这是什么地方
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.27,0:12:02.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Where am I?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:04.92,0:12:05.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,完成
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.92,0:12:05.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Check
Dialogue: 1,0:12:05.52,0:12:06.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,派大星
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.52,0:12:06.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hey, Patrick
Dialogue: 1,0:12:06.82,0:12:07.91,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,目标达成了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.82,0:12:07.91,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We hit our goal
Dialogue: 1,0:12:09.52,0:12:10.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好耶
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.52,0:12:10.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Alright
Dialogue: 1,0:12:11.65,0:12:13.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,再见了  先生
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.65,0:12:13.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Good day to you, sir
Dialogue: 1,0:12:15.60,0:12:16.84,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.60,0:12:16.84,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh, dear
Dialogue: 1,0:12:16.84,0:12:19.84,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,要是再得到一枚高级童子军徽章
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.84,0:12:19.84,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,If we earn just one more Senior Scouts badge
Dialogue: 1,0:12:19.84,0:12:23.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就能升级到超高级童子军了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.84,0:12:23.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,we graduate to Superior Senior Scouts
Dialogue: 1,0:12:24.27,0:12:25.36,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,还剩什么呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.27,0:12:25.36,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What's left?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:27.73,0:12:30.77,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,哄老人开心的专属听众徽章
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.73,0:12:30.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The Captive Listener badge for Humoring the Elderly
Dialogue: 1,0:12:30.77,0:12:32.29,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,小菜一碟
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.77,0:12:32.29,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,This'll be a cinch
Dialogue: 1,0:12:32.29,0:12:35.03,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,老人天生就很会讲故事
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.29,0:12:35.03,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Senior citizens are natural born storytellers
Dialogue: 1,0:12:35.03,0:12:36.99,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我已经听了派大爷
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.03,0:12:36.99,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I've been listening to GrandPat
Dialogue: 1,0:12:36.99,0:12:39.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,讲同一个无聊故事很多年了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.99,0:12:39.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,tell the same boring stories for years
Dialogue: 1,0:12:39.92,0:12:42.24,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我就知道总有一天会有回报
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.92,0:12:42.24,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I knew it would pay off one day
Dialogue: 1,0:12:42.56,0:12:44.78,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,看来我现在就住这里了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.56,0:12:44.78,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, I guess I live here now
Dialogue: 1,0:12:46.32,0:12:47.60,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,谢谢你请我们来
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.32,0:12:47.60,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Thanks for having us over
Dialogue: 1,0:12:47.60,0:12:50.16,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,听你讲故事  梅干宝宝老太太
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.60,0:12:50.16,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,to listen to your stories, Old Lady Baby Prunes
Dialogue: 1,0:12:50.16,0:12:51.66,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们高级童子军认为
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.16,0:12:51.66,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We Senior Scouts believe--
Dialogue: 1,0:12:53.49,0:12:55.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,最多听十分钟
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.49,0:12:55.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You get ten minutes
Dialogue: 1,0:12:55.31,0:12:57.04,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,玛丽  开始计时
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.31,0:12:57.04,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Mary, start the clock
Dialogue: 1,0:12:59.82,0:13:00.96,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你们比较想听
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.82,0:13:00.96,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now, would you rather hear
Dialogue: 1,0:13:00.96,0:13:04.23,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我的胃溃疡还是椎间盘突出
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.96,0:13:04.23,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,about my stomach ulcer or my herniated disk?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:04.23,0:13:06.49,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,妈  讲讲你带状疱疹的故事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.23,0:13:06.49,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Ma, tell the one about your shingles
Dialogue: 1,0:13:06.49,0:13:07.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,超级独特呢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.49,0:13:07.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,it's a doozy
Dialogue: 1,0:13:08.49,0:13:09.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,带状疱疹
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.49,0:13:09.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Shingles
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.49,0:13:09.57,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\fs60\pos(960,920)}屋 顶 板
Dialogue: 1,0:13:09.57,0:13:10.86,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好刺激
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.57,0:13:10.86,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,How thrilling
Dialogue: 1,0:13:11.18,0:13:14.08,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,派大星  这一定会比我们想象中简单
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.18,0:13:14.08,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Patrick, this is gonna be even easier than I thought
Dialogue: 1,0:13:17.80,0:13:19.19,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,是巧克力
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.80,0:13:19.19,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Chocolate
Dialogue: 1,0:13:19.45,0:13:20.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,干嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.45,0:13:20.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:20.54,0:13:23.32,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我听故事都会吃个小点心
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.54,0:13:23.32,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I always have a light snack at story time
Dialogue: 1,0:13:23.32,0:13:25.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,妈讨厌巧克力  你个白痴
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.32,0:13:25.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Ma hates chocolate, you buffoon
Dialogue: 1,0:13:25.64,0:13:26.53,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,把它拿开
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.64,0:13:26.53,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Put that away
Dialogue: 1,0:13:26.91,0:13:28.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,拿开就拿开
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.91,0:13:28.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,If you insist
Dialogue: 1,0:13:32.53,0:13:33.83,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,够了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.53,0:13:33.83,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That does it
Dialogue: 1,0:13:34.38,0:13:36.41,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,滚出去
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.38,0:13:36.41,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Get out
Dialogue: 1,0:13:44.56,0:13:45.78,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不好意思  梅干小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.56,0:13:45.78,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Pardon me, Miss Prunes
Dialogue: 1,0:13:45.78,0:13:47.46,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你为什么会讨厌巧克力呢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.78,0:13:47.46,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,but why do you hate chocolate?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:47.46,0:13:48.49,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.46,0:13:48.49,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:48.72,0:13:50.03,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.72,0:13:50.03,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:50.58,0:13:53.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,从来没人那么问过我
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.58,0:13:53.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No one's ever asked me that before
Dialogue: 1,0:13:53.72,0:13:54.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,玛丽
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.72,0:13:54.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Mary
Dialogue: 1,0:13:54.57,0:13:56.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我怀旧感上来了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.57,0:13:56.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm feeling nostalgic
Dialogue: 1,0:13:56.79,0:13:58.31,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不用喊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.79,0:13:58.31,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You don't have to yell
Dialogue: 1,0:13:59.06,0:14:00.25,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这我熟
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.06,0:14:00.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I know the drill
Dialogue: 1,0:14:03.33,0:14:04.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你们自在点
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.33,0:14:04.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Get comfy, boys
Dialogue: 1,0:14:04.50,0:14:06.32,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,得暂时在这待一会儿了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.50,0:14:06.32,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We're gonna be here awhile
Dialogue: 1,0:14:10.02,0:14:11.99,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,很多年前
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.02,0:14:11.99,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Many years ago
Dialogue: 1,0:14:11.99,0:14:15.21,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我是全世界最可爱的小女孩
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.99,0:14:15.21,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I was the cutest little girl in the world
Dialogue: 1,0:14:15.21,0:14:18.61,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,在我得到梅干宝宝老太太这一名号前
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.21,0:14:18.61,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Before you knew me as Old Lady Baby Prunes
Dialogue: 1,0:14:18.61,0:14:22.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,公众都称我为小梅干宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.61,0:14:22.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,the public knew me as Little Baby Prunes
Dialogue: 1,0:14:24.13,0:14:26.18,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,但是竞争很激烈
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.13,0:14:26.18,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,But the competition was stiff
Dialogue: 1,0:14:36.31,0:14:38.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那是个小可爱弱肉强食的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.31,0:14:38.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It was a doll-eat-doll world
Dialogue: 1,0:14:38.55,0:14:41.44,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,要想登顶  就必须无情
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.55,0:14:41.44,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,To get to the top, I had to be ruthless
Dialogue: 1,0:14:47.61,0:14:48.91,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,哎哟
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.61,0:14:48.91,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oopsie
Dialogue: 1,0:14:48.91,0:14:50.43,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,先走一步
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.91,0:14:50.43,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Gotta go
Dialogue: 1,0:14:55.16,0:14:59.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可爱的套路让我一夜成名
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.16,0:14:59.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,My cutesy-poo shtick made me an overnight sensation
Dialogue: 1,0:15:00.30,0:15:03.79,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,全世界都为梅干而狂
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.30,0:15:03.79,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The whole world's gone looney for Pruney
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.63,0:15:03.79,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1362,198)}裤头村号角报
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.63,0:15:03.79,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1380,504)}为梅干而狂
Dialogue: 1,0:15:04.02,0:15:07.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,梅干的名字口口相传
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.02,0:15:07.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The name on everybody's lips is Prunes
Dialogue: 1,0:15:07.74,0:15:10.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,也就是小梅干宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.74,0:15:10.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Little Baby Prunes, that is
Dialogue: 1,0:15:10.49,0:15:11.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,哎哟
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.49,0:15:11.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oopsie
Dialogue: 1,0:15:11.47,0:15:12.24,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,先走
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.47,0:15:12.24,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Gotta
Dialogue: 1,0:15:12.24,0:15:13.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,一步
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.24,0:15:13.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Go
Dialogue: 1,0:15:14.57,0:15:15.77,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好棒
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.57,0:15:15.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Attagirl
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.97,0:15:24.48,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1152,322)}便宜货超市
Dialogue: 1,0:15:18.38,0:15:20.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我这位新星冉冉升起
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.38,0:15:20.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,With my star on the rise
Dialogue: 1,0:15:20.50,0:15:24.48,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,便代言起了一款全新的梅干糖
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.50,0:15:24.48,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I became the spokesperson for a new prune candy
Dialogue: 1,0:15:24.92,0:15:26.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,热情常客
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.92,0:15:26.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,"Peppy Regulars"
Dialogue: 1,0:15:33.38,0:15:35.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,是热情常客
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.38,0:15:35.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's Peppy Regulars
Dialogue: 1,0:15:35.77,0:15:37.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,大家都止不住称赞
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.77,0:15:37.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Everyone's agog
Dialogue: 1,0:15:37.37,0:15:41.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,小梅干宝宝优选的梅子含片
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.37,0:15:39.71,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,over the preferred plum pastille
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.71,0:15:41.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,of Little Baby Prunes
Dialogue: 1,0:15:42.40,0:15:45.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,只要咬上一口热情常客  就会说
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.40,0:15:45.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,One bite of Peppy Regulars and you'll be saying
Dialogue: 1,0:15:46.32,0:15:47.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,哎哟
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.32,0:15:47.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oopsie
Dialogue: 1,0:15:47.71,0:15:49.34,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,先走一步
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.71,0:15:49.34,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Gotta go
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.71,0:15:49.34,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\fs60\pos(988,920)}上 厕 所
Dialogue: 1,0:15:50.97,0:15:53.01,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,梅干糖
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.97,0:15:53.01,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Prune candy?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:53.21,0:15:55.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,一听就恶心
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.21,0:15:55.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sounds gross
Dialogue: 1,0:15:56.14,0:15:57.39,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我要尝尝看
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.14,0:15:57.39,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I wanna try it
Dialogue: 1,0:15:57.39,0:15:58.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我也要
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.39,0:15:58.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Me too
Dialogue: 1,0:15:58.10,0:15:58.79,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我也要
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.10,0:15:58.79,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Me too
Dialogue: 1,0:15:58.79,0:16:00.34,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,别害羞哦
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.79,0:16:00.34,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Don't be shy, boys
Dialogue: 1,0:16:00.55,0:16:02.53,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,糖果还有不少呢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.55,0:16:02.53,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,there's plenty more where that came from
Dialogue: 1,0:16:08.15,0:16:09.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,哎哟
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.15,0:16:09.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oopsie
Dialogue: 1,0:16:09.33,0:16:10.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,先走一步
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.33,0:16:10.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Gotta go
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.33,0:16:10.12,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\fs60\pos(988,920)}上 厕 所
Dialogue: 1,0:16:10.94,0:16:13.60,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,再不快点就会错过蒙太奇
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.94,0:16:13.60,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hurry up or you'll miss the montage
Dialogue: 1,0:16:14.04,0:16:15.99,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我最爱的就是这段
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.04,0:16:15.99,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,This is my favorite part
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.45,0:16:20.25,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1308,436)}梅干大亨
Dialogue: 1,0:16:18.70,0:16:20.25,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,梅干大亨
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.70,0:16:20.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Prune Tycoon
Dialogue: 1,0:16:21.15,0:16:23.97,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,大家最爱的跳舞小可爱
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.15,0:16:23.97,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Everyone's favorite dancing doll
Dialogue: 1,0:16:23.97,0:16:28.39,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,正享受着台上台下巨大的成功
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.97,0:16:28.39,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,is enjoying great success on and off the stage
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.21,0:16:31.26,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(444,290)}音乐会
Dialogue: 1,0:16:44.33,0:16:47.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,抱歉  这跟巧克力有什么关系
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.33,0:16:47.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but what does this have to do with chocolate?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:47.00,0:16:48.88,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,快讲到了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.00,0:16:48.88,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm getting to it
Dialogue: 1,0:16:49.29,0:16:50.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,到哪了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.29,0:16:50.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Where was I?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:50.47,0:16:52.03,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.47,0:16:52.03,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah
Dialogue: 1,0:16:52.37,0:16:55.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,一年年过去  我依旧遥遥领先
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.37,0:16:55.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The years went by and I stayed on top
Dialogue: 1,0:16:55.68,0:16:58.20,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,大家还是热爱梅干
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.68,0:16:58.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Everyone still loved Prunes
Dialogue: 1,0:16:58.46,0:17:02.58,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,直到有一天  一切轰然倒塌
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.46,0:17:02.58,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Until one day, it all came crashing down
Dialogue: 1,0:17:09.72,0:17:10.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这还是
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.72,0:17:10.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,This is still
Dialogue: 1,0:17:11.36,0:17:12.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,很好吃
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.36,0:17:12.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,delicious
Dialogue: 1,0:17:15.01,0:17:19.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,谁都无法发明出比梅干糖还棒的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.01,0:17:17.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No one could ever invent something
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.22,0:17:19.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,better than prune candy
Dialogue: 1,0:17:20.22,0:17:21.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,大家听我说
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.22,0:17:21.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hey, everyone
Dialogue: 1,0:17:21.22,0:17:22.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,有个法国人发明出了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.22,0:17:22.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Some French guy just invented
Dialogue: 1,0:17:22.95,0:17:24.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,比梅干糖还棒的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.95,0:17:24.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,something better than prune candy
Dialogue: 1,0:17:24.92,0:17:26.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,叫做巧克力
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.92,0:17:26.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's called chocolate
Dialogue: 1,0:17:26.82,0:17:28.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,跟我来
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.82,0:17:28.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Follow me
Dialogue: 1,0:17:28.84,0:17:29.63,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.84,0:17:29.63,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:29.63,0:17:30.24,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.63,0:17:30.24,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:37.25,0:17:40.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,刚刚发明出的这个甜点
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.25,0:17:40.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,This dessert just now invented
Dialogue: 1,0:17:40.05,0:17:45.99,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,已被牢牢公认为全世界最佳
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.05,0:17:42.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,has already been cemented
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.45,0:17:45.99,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,as the best far and wide in the land-y
Dialogue: 1,0:17:46.34,0:17:48.33,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,快过来  别不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.34,0:17:48.33,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Step up and don't be shy
Dialogue: 1,0:17:48.60,0:17:51.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,因为这点心一定要吃一吃
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.60,0:17:51.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,for this treat that you must try
Dialogue: 1,0:17:51.42,0:17:55.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,它可是颗美味的巧克力糖哦
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.42,0:17:55.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,is a tasty piece of chocolate candy
Dialogue: 1,0:17:59.95,0:18:01.20,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,哎哟
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.95,0:18:01.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Whoopsie
Dialogue: 1,0:18:01.20,0:18:02.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,吃光光了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.20,0:18:02.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,All gone
Dialogue: 1,0:18:06.31,0:18:10.39,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,她名叫小邦尼夹心糖
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.31,0:18:10.39,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Her name was Lil Bonnie Bonbon
Dialogue: 1,0:18:10.70,0:18:12.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,她一粉墨登场
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.70,0:18:12.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Once she arrived on the scene
Dialogue: 1,0:18:12.70,0:18:17.13,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,大家就只谈巧克力
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.70,0:18:17.13,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,all anybody could talk about was chocolate
Dialogue: 1,0:18:18.35,0:18:23.58,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,朱古力
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.35,0:18:23.58,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Chocolat
Dialogue: 1,0:18:23.58,0:18:25.77,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我失去了观众
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.58,0:18:25.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I had lost my audience
Dialogue: 1,0:18:29.44,0:18:31.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,但我决心要赢回他们
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.44,0:18:31.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,But I was determined to win 'em back
Dialogue: 1,0:18:31.96,0:18:35.59,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我要再次无情起来
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.96,0:18:35.59,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and I was gonna be ruthless again
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.34,0:18:42.51,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(894,228)}裤头村著名剧院
Dialogue: 1,0:18:48.50,0:18:50.25,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,五分钟后上场  夹心糖小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.50,0:18:50.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Five minutes, Miss Bonbon
Dialogue: 1,0:18:55.97,0:18:56.99,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,放我出去
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.97,0:18:56.99,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Let me outta here
Dialogue: 1,0:18:57.24,0:19:00.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,哎哟  先走一步
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.24,0:19:00.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oopsie, gotta go
Dialogue: 1,0:19:03.80,0:19:04.73,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,请欢迎
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.80,0:19:04.73,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Please welcome
Dialogue: 1,0:19:04.73,0:19:07.48,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,史上最新最可爱的小女孩
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.73,0:19:07.48,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,the newest, cutest little girl ever
Dialogue: 1,0:19:07.80,0:19:08.39,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你谁啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.80,0:19:08.39,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:08.39,0:19:09.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,怎么进来的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.39,0:19:09.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,How did you get in here?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:10.81,0:19:13.41,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,小梅干宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.81,0:19:13.41,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Little Baby Prunes
Dialogue: 1,0:19:16.08,0:19:16.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,恶心
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.08,0:19:16.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yuck
Dialogue: 1,0:19:16.72,0:19:18.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这不是巧克力
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.72,0:19:18.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,This isn't chocolate
Dialogue: 1,0:19:18.96,0:19:20.51,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,搞什么啊  小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.96,0:19:20.51,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What gives, lady?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:20.73,0:19:22.09,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,恶心死了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.73,0:19:22.09,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,This is gross
Dialogue: 1,0:19:23.11,0:19:24.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,巧克力
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.11,0:19:24.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Chocolate?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:24.36,0:19:25.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,巧克力
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.36,0:19:25.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Chocolate?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:25.10,0:19:26.77,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,朱古力
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.10,0:19:26.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Chocolat
Dialogue: 1,0:19:27.48,0:19:29.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,巧克力哪里好了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.48,0:19:29.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What's so great about chocolate anyway?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:41.73,0:19:45.25,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他们越喝彩  我巧克力就吃得越多
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.73,0:19:45.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The more they cheered, the more chocolate I ate
Dialogue: 1,0:19:45.46,0:19:49.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不知不觉间  我就失控了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.46,0:19:49.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Before I knew it, I had lost control
Dialogue: 1,0:19:55.25,0:19:56.31,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,哎哟
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.25,0:19:56.31,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oopsie
Dialogue: 1,0:19:56.31,0:19:57.25,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,先
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.31,0:19:57.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Gotta
Dialogue: 1,0:19:58.07,0:19:59.09,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,先
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.07,0:19:59.09,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Gotta
Dialogue: 1,0:20:09.66,0:20:11.43,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,她内脏外翻了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.66,0:20:11.43,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,She's inside out
Dialogue: 1,0:20:16.25,0:20:18.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,梅干没法干了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.25,0:20:18.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Prunes is ruined
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.48,0:20:27.58,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1294,540)}梅干没法干了
Dialogue: 1,0:20:18.15,0:20:20.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,从小跳着踢踏舞  长大升为大红人
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.15,0:20:20.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The tap dancing tot turned white hot big shot
Dialogue: 1,0:20:20.87,0:20:24.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,经历巧克力事故  从此彻底过了气
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.87,0:20:24.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,is but an afterthought after fraught chocolate spot
Dialogue: 1,0:20:24.30,0:20:27.58,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,哎哟  她确实得先走一步了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.30,0:20:27.58,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oopsie, she's gotta go, indeed
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.49,0:20:33.46,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1412,532)}完
Dialogue: 1,0:20:30.29,0:20:34.40,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,小子们  所以我才讨厌巧克力
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.29,0:20:34.40,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And that, boys, is the reason why I hate chocolate
Dialogue: 1,0:20:36.25,0:20:39.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那真是我听过最伤心的故事了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.25,0:20:39.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That was the saddest thing I've ever heard
Dialogue: 1,0:20:39.00,0:20:42.40,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对啊  浪费了好多糖果
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.00,0:20:42.40,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yeah, so much wasted candy
Dialogue: 1,0:20:45.84,0:20:48.14,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那不可能是故事的结局
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.84,0:20:48.14,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That can't be the end of the story
Dialogue: 1,0:20:48.14,0:20:49.44,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你可是个舞蹈家
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.14,0:20:49.44,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You were a dancer
Dialogue: 1,0:20:49.44,0:20:51.84,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,全世界最可爱的小女孩
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.44,0:20:51.84,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The cutest little girl in the world
Dialogue: 1,0:20:51.84,0:20:54.33,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对啊  现在我一生都泡汤了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.84,0:20:54.33,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yeah, and now I'm all washed up
Dialogue: 1,0:20:54.33,0:20:56.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,再也没人想要梅干了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.33,0:20:56.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Nobody wants Prunes anymore
Dialogue: 1,0:20:56.87,0:20:57.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.87,0:20:57.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 1,0:20:57.65,0:20:59.16,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那样不对
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.65,0:20:59.16,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That's not true
Dialogue: 1,0:20:59.60,0:21:01.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,等一下  有了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.60,0:21:01.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute, that's it
Dialogue: 1,0:21:01.70,0:21:04.78,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,有不少人还爱着梅干
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.70,0:21:04.78,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,There's plenty of people who still love Prunes
Dialogue: 1,0:21:05.05,0:21:07.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我知道要上哪去找他们
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.05,0:21:07.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and I know just where to find them
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.20,0:21:10.99,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1618,322)}荫凉滩疗养院
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.20,0:21:10.99,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(382,652)}小梅干宝宝\N重返舞台
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.20,0:21:10.99,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1172,968)}梅干宝宝
Dialogue: 1,0:21:11.24,0:21:13.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,老女士们老先生们
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.24,0:21:13.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Old ladies and old gentlemen
Dialogue: 1,0:21:13.80,0:21:15.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,有请回归舞台的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.80,0:21:15.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,returning to the stage
Dialogue: 1,0:21:15.42,0:21:18.44,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,小梅干宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.42,0:21:18.44,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,it's Little Baby Prunes
Dialogue: 1,0:21:25.16,0:21:27.69,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,小梅干宝宝吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.16,0:21:27.69,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Little Baby Prunes?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:28.02,0:21:29.93,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,天啊  今夕是何年
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.02,0:21:29.93,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,By golly, what year is it?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:30.29,0:21:31.46,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,成功了  派大星
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.29,0:21:31.46,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We did it, Patrick
Dialogue: 1,0:21:31.46,0:21:34.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们得到了超高级童子军徽章
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.46,0:21:34.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We earned our Superior Senior Scout badges
Dialogue: 1,0:21:34.42,0:21:37.19,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,而且梅干宝宝也找回了自己的观众
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.42,0:21:37.19,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and Baby Prunes found her audience again
Dialogue: 1,0:21:38.40,0:21:40.85,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,该更上一层楼了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.40,0:21:40.85,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Time to turn things up a notch
Dialogue: 1,0:21:44.32,0:21:46.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,哎哟  先
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.32,0:21:46.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oopsie, gotta
Dialogue: 1,0:21:46.27,0:21:46.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,先
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.27,0:21:46.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Gotta
Dialogue: 1,0:22:02.71,0:22:05.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,感觉我返老还童了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.71,0:22:05.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I feel like a kid again
Dialogue: 1,0:22:06.66,0:22:08.63,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我真返老还童了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.66,0:22:08.63,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I am a kid again
Dialogue: 1,0:22:16.10,0:22:17.68,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,朱古力
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.10,0:22:17.68,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Chocolat
